# UK1 character GLB: after Draco compression the file is ~67 MB (well under
# GitHub's 100 MB hard limit). Committed to the repo so GitHub Pages serves
# it from the same origin as index.html / ipad.html — avoids the CORS issue
# that release-asset URLs hit when fetched from JS on the Pages site.
# (Original FBX is ~478 MB and stays outside the repo.)
# uk1_outboxer.glb  -- intentionally NOT ignored

# Conversion artifacts (large, regenerable)
_convert_uk1.log

